      "locked": false,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "FIFOEvictionPolicy<K>   implements EvictionPolicy<K>\n──────────────────────────\n- insertionOrder: LinkedHashSet<K>\n──────────────────────────\n+ keyAdded(K)               O(1)  append to back\n+ keyAccessed(K)            NO-OP  ← defines FIFO\n+ keyRemoved(K)             O(1)\n+ selectEvictionCandidate() O(1)  oldest arrival\n\nReads never reorder — a hot key still ages out.",
      "originalText": "FIFOEvictionPolicy<K>   implements EvictionPolicy<K>\n──────────────────────────\n- insertionOrder: LinkedHashSet<K>\n──────────────────────────\n+ keyAdded(K)               O(1)  append to back\n+ keyAccessed(K)            NO-OP  ← defines FIFO\n+ keyRemoved(K)             O(1)\n+ selectEvictionCandidate() O(1)  oldest arrival\n\nReads never reorder — a hot key still ages out.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
