      "text": "LinkedHashMapLRUEvictionPolicy<K>   implements EvictionPolicy<K>\n──────────────────────────\n- order: LinkedHashMap<K, Boolean>\n        «new LinkedHashMap<>(16, 0.75f, true)»\n──────────────────────────\n+ keyAdded(K)               order.put(key, TRUE)\n+ keyAccessed(K)            order.get(key)  ← get() reorders\n+ keyRemoved(K)             order.remove(key)\n+ selectEvictionCandidate() first key = LRU\n\nSame LRU in 5 lines. SHIP this; don't LEAD with it.",
      "originalText": "LinkedHashMapLRUEvictionPolicy<K>   implements EvictionPolicy<K>\n──────────────────────────\n- order: LinkedHashMap<K, Boolean>\n        «new LinkedHashMap<>(16, 0.75f, true)»\n──────────────────────────\n+ keyAdded(K)               order.put(key, TRUE)\n+ keyAccessed(K)            order.get(key)  ← get() reorders\n+ keyRemoved(K)             order.remove(key)\n+ selectEvictionCandidate() first key = LRU\n\nSame LRU in 5 lines. SHIP this; don't LEAD with it.",
